<title>PAKISTAN: Shell Pakistan first half net up 271 pct.</title>
<headline>Shell Pakistan first half net up 271 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-02-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended December 31, 1996 (in million rupees):</p>
<p>    Sales		 11,392 vs 8,711</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	 629 vs   171</p>
<p>    Post-tax profit	379 vs   102</p>
<p>    Interim div I     35 pct vs 25 pct</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name is Shell Pakistan Ltd. It is 51 percent owned by Royal Dutch Petroleum Co. Book closure March 20-27.</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
